# Vibe Check (Cursor)

When the user asks for a vibe check, compliance check or pre-launch audit:

1. Run the scanner from the project root: `node .cursor/vibe-check/scripts/scan.mjs . --md` (Node 18+, no dependencies).
2. Open every cited file:line and confirm. Scanner hits are leads, not verdicts.
3. Follow the full instructions in `.cursor/vibe-check/SKILL.md` and the 16 checks in `.cursor/vibe-check/references/CHECKS.md`.
4. Report PASS / FAIL / NEEDS REVIEW per check with evidence and a concrete fix. Use conditional wording ("If you have EU visitors…"), only the verified figures in `references/SOURCES.md`, never add penalties into a total, and never say "compliant" or "legally safe".
5. End with: "Educational check, not legal advice. Laws change and depend on your facts. Confirm with a qualified lawyer before relying on this."
